ACS contributor&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0078D4;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;align=left;spacingLeft=57;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="810" width="280" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-i42" value="" style="aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="823" width="43" height="43" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-m43" value="&lt;b&gt;azd hook&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;postprovision: create-voice-agent.py" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="810" width="600" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-m44" value="&lt;b&gt;Order&lt;/b&gt;: 1 platform azd provision → 2 load-knowledge-index.py → 3 buy ACS number → 4 use-shared-platform.ps1 -Example &amp;lt;x&amp;gt; [-AppLocation eastus2] [-Telephony acs,twilio,asterisk] → 5 azd up per example → 6 configure-telephony.ps1 (ACS/Twilio) or Asterisk websocket_client.conf.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standalone instead&lt;/b&gt;: each example has its own Foundry resource + 'voice-agents' project; knowledge/ (rg-&amp;lt;kb-env&amp;gt;) supplies AI Search via use-knowledge-base.ps1." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#605E5C;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="740" width="620" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-m45" value="&lt;b&gt;Roles granted to each app identity&lt;/b&gt; (shared-access.bicep)&lt;br&gt;• Foundry: Cognitive Services User + Foundry User (Voice Live, voice agent) or Cognitive Services OpenAI User (Realtime)&lt;br&gt;• Azure AI Search: Search Index Data Reader · ACS: Contributor (Call Automation)&lt;br&gt;• Deploying user: Foundry/OpenAI roles + Search contributor roles (agent creation, index load)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4EFFA;strokeColor=#5C2D91;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="845" width="620" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
